# Keep every text file LF, in the repo and in the working tree.
#
# Without this, `core.autocrlf=true` checks files out as CRLF while Prettier
# (endOfLine: "lf") writes LF — so `npm run format:check` would fail on every
# file right after a fresh clone, and every edit would look like it changed
# the whole file.
* text=auto eol=lf
